        "created_at": "2024-07-03T21:51:35.722Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There’s a feature in Super Smash Bros. Ultimate called Spirit Teams. Spirit fights have a stage, fighter, rank, and special conditions. So, I made the SotM characters as Spirits. I’ll update more in the future!<br>\nTo start with, I made the og 4 Dark Watch members. These stages all take place on battlefield Fourside, for Rook City.</p>\n<p>Mr. Fixer<br>\nAlt 5 Ryu works pretty perfectly. He starts with a killing edge for the tools, has a stat increase at low health for the variant and has extra physical attack. Also, he doesn’t use specials.</p>\n<p>Expatriette<br>\nPurple Joker was the best choice. For her buffed neutral special, she wields a gun, which is the main move she uses. She starts with a ray gun, and has her shooting attack buffed, and shooting items are the only ones that show up.</p>\n<p>Nightmist<br>\nFemale Robin is a great fit. She starts with a staff for the relics, has trade-off ability for the self-damage. Also magic attack is buffed, and she spams specials.</p>\n<p>Setback<br>\nUses Dragon Quest 7 Hero which mainly uses down b with buffed attacks. He also has a chance to get a crit. He starts with a Ramblin’ Evil Mushroom, which inverts controls.</p>\n<p>More in the future!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-07-03T21:51:35.722Z",
